          ],
          "player_feedback_ids": [
            "feedback-002",
            "feedback-005"
          ]
        },
        {
          "category": "friction",
          "statement": "The current PC release can require extra setup outside the game itself: recent exact-app reviews report Rockstar Launcher access problems, while other current players still recommend community fixes for port performance and modern-system compatibility.",
